1
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:04,400
海那边，会有什么？
What lies beyond the sea?

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:06,600
在山东蓬莱，
In Penglai, Shandong,

3
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:08,700
人们把向海的想象，
dreams of the sea

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:12,300
讲成了八仙过海的故事。
became the tale of the Eight Immortals.

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,600
在山东蓬莱，人们把向海的想象，
In Penglai, Shandong, dreams of the sea

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,200
讲成了八仙过海的故事。
became the tale of the Eight Immortals.

7
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:24,600
不坐船，咱各凭本事，过海去！
No boats. Let's cross the sea, each in our own way!

8
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,800
好！看谁先到！
All right! Let's see who gets there first!

9
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,300
各有本领，也能并肩同行。
Different gifts can carry us forward together.

10
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:49,800
海那边，也有人这样望着我们吗？
Beyond the sea, is someone looking this way too?

11
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,600
去相见，才会知道。
We'll only know when we meet.

12
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,500
传说之外，
Beyond the legend,

13
00:01:12,850 --> 00:01:16,200
人们早已扬帆远行。
people had long set sail.

14
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:20,000
海上丝绸之路，连接起不同的港口与生活。
The Maritime Silk Roads connected ports and ways of life.

15
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:29,000
瓷器
Porcelain.

16
00:01:39,050 --> 00:01:41,300
呃……瓷器。
Porcelain.

17
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:45,400
跨过海的不只是货物。
More than goods crossed the sea.

18
00:01:51,950 --> 00:01:57,000
一句新学的话，一次耐心的倾听，让陌生的人慢慢走近。
A newly learned word and a moment of listening brought strangers closer.

19
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,700
今天，远洋航线仍在延伸；文化交流又有了新的渡口。
Today ocean routes still continue, and exchange has found new places to meet.

20
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:22,300
八位仙人，八种渡海方式？
Eight immortals, eight ways across?

21
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:32,250
在我的家乡，大海也诉说着故事。
Back home, the sea tells stories too.

22
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:45,900
从八仙的想象，到帆船的远航，再到今天的相遇，
From the Eight Immortals' imagined crossing to voyages under sail and encounters today,

23
00:02:45,900 --> 00:02:49,050
大海让不同的故事有机会彼此听见。
the sea brings different stories within reach of one another.

